t 12:17pm" data-utime="1323721070" class="timestamp livetimestamp">13 hours ago</abbr> · <span class="comment_like_125128 fsm fwn fcg"><a tooltip="1" tooltip-uri="/ajax/like/tooltip.php?comment_fbid=124123947702890&amp;comment_from=100002462065329" title="Loading..." tooltip-alignh="center" class="comment_like_button" rel="dialog" href="/browse/likes/?id=124123947702890" ajaxify="/ajax/browser/dialog/likes/?id=124123947702890"><img class="cmt_like_icon" src="https://s-static.ak.facebook.com/rsrc.php/v1/yw/r/drP8vlvSl_8.gif" alt="" /> 1</a></span></div></div></div></li><li class="uiUfiComment comment_125145 ufiItem ufiItem"><div class="UIImageBlock clearfix uiUfiActorBlock"><a class="actorPic UIImageBlock_Image UIImageBlock_SMALL_Image" data-ft="&#123;&quot;type&quot;:34&#125;" tabindex="-1" href="http://www.facebook.com/bogdana.butnar"><img class="uiProfilePhoto uiProfilePhotoMedium img" src="https://fbcdn-profile-a.akamaihd.net/hprofile-ak-ash2/211754_654587008_534434799_q.jpg" alt="" /></a><div class="UIImageBlock_Ext"><div class="uiSelector inlineBlock commentHideSelector stat_elem uiSelectorRight" id="uqa6bd_23" data-name="hide_option[125145]" data-autosubmit="1"><div class="wrap"><a class="uiSelectorButton uiCloseButton" ajaxify="/ajax/ufi/hide_selector.php?comment_id=125145&amp;commenter_id=654587008&amp;profile_id=100001767859475&amp;post_fbid=124125414369410&amp;can_remove=0&amp;can_report=1&amp;report_link=%2Fajax%2Freport.php%3Fcontent_type%3D74%26cid%3D124125414369410%26rid%3D654587008%26cid2%3D0%26profile%3D100001767859475%26h%3DAfhKB8ZyBOz481K2&amp;feedback_params=%7B%22actor%22%3A%22100001767859475%22%2C%22target_fbid%22%3A%22123516947763590%22%2C%22target_profile_id%22%3A%22100001767859475%22%2C%22type_id%22%3A%2217%22%2C%22source%22%3A%222%22%2C%22assoc_obj_id%22%3A%22%22%2C%22source_app_id%22%3A%220%22%2C%22extra_story_params%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22content_timestamp%22%3A%221323636156%22%2C%22check_hash%22%3A%2220face31b9c44b99%22%7D" title="" href="#" role="button" aria-haspopup="1" onmouseover="window.Selector &amp;&amp; onloadRegister(Selector.loadMenu.curry($(&#039;uqa6bd_23&#039;)));" rel="toggle"></a></div><input type="submit" class="submitButton" value="Submit" /></div></div><div class="commentContent UIImageBlock_Content UIImageBlock_SMALL_Content" data-ft="&#123;&quot;type&quot;:33&#125;"><a class="actorName" data-ft="&#123;&quot;type&quot;:35&#125;" href="http://www.facebook.com/bogdana.butnar">Bogdana Butnar</a> <span data-jsid="text" class="commentBody">Nu stiu cum sa iti raspund. Ma tem insa ca si certurile astea nu se vor termina niciodata daca nimeni nu intelege de ce e necesar sa se intample chestia asta. Toti tb sa intelegem ca advertiserii valideaza un ecosistem nu numai indivizi. Blogosfera e un ecosistem si daca acesta nu mai exista atunci si ideea de blogvertising o sa dispara. ptr toti.<span class="translatedBody"></span></span><div class="commentActions fsm fwn fcg"><abbr title="Monday, December 12, 2011 at 12:20pm" data-utime="1323721228" class="timestamp livetimestamp">13 hours ago</abbr></div></div></div></li><li class="uiUfiComment comment_125185 ufiItem ufiItem"><div class="UIImageBlock clearfix uiUfiActorBlock"><a class="actorPic UIImageBlock_Image UIImageBlock_SMALL_Image" data-ft="&#123;&quot;type&quot;:34&#125;" tabindex="-1" href="http://www.facebook.com/cetin.ametcea"><img class="uiProfilePhoto uiProfilePhotoMedium img" src="https://fbcdn-profile-a.akamaihd.net/hprofile-ak-snc4/276035_100002462065329_2129028447_q.jpg" alt="" /></a><div class="UIImageBlock_Ext"><div class="uiSelector inlineBlock commentHideSelector stat_elem uiSelectorRight" id="uqa6bd_24" data-name="hide_option[125185]" data-autosubmit="1"><div class="wrap"><a class="uiSelectorButton uiCloseButton" ajaxify="/ajax/ufi/hide_selector.php?comment_id=125185&amp;commenter_id=100002462065329&amp;profile_id=100001767859475&amp;post_fbid=124132021035416&amp;can_remove=0&amp;can_report=1&amp;report_link=%2Fajax%2Freport.php%3Fcontent_type%3D74%26cid%3D124132021035416%26rid%3D100002462065329%26cid2%3D0%26profile%3D100001767859475%26h%3DAfh3jaVZNyfw3O0q&amp;feedback_params=%7B%22actor%22%3A%22100001767859475%22%2C%22target_fbid%22%3A%22123516947763590%22%2C%22target_profile_id%22%3A%22100001767859475%22%2C%22type_id%22%3A%2217%22%2C%22source%22%3A%222%22%2C%22assoc_obj_id%22%3A%22%22%2C%22source_app_id%22%3A%220%22%2C%22extra_story_params%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22content_timestamp%22%3A%221323636156%22%2C%22check_hash%22%3A%2220face31b9c44b99%22%7D" title="" href="#" role="button" aria-haspopup="1" onmouseover="window.Selector &amp;&amp; onloadRegister(Selector.loadMenu.curry($(&#039;uqa6bd_24&#039;)));" rel="toggle"></a></div><input type="submit" class="submitButton" value="Submit" /></div></div><div class="commentContent UIImageBlock_Content UIImageBlock_SMALL_Content" data-ft="&#123;&quot;type&quot;:33&#125;"><a class="actorName" data-ft="&#123;&quot;type&quot;:35&#125;" href="http://www.facebook.com/cetin.ametcea">Cetin Ametcea</a> <span data-jsid="text" class="commentBody"><div id="id_4ee71f45c0a895d38516849" class="text_exposed_root">tu nu intelegi ceva. ca nu imi pasa de ecosistem.  EU  mi-am facut blog cand varabiescu nici nu se gandea la publicitate pe bloguri. EU in loc sa fiue tinut in brate, cum e propaganda acum, luam muie de la zoso, ca eram prost si nu stiam ni<span class="text_exposed_hide">...</span><span class="text_exposed_show">mic. doar ca eu am ales sa invat si sa merg mai departe. acest ecosistem exista  in marea sa majoritate, pentru bani. noi, astia pe care ne blamezi, am existat pentru ca aveam de ce sa scriem, simteam nevoia de  a ne exprima si gasisem un teren nou si fertil. advertiserii ne-au dat bani cand nu existam ca ecosistem, ci ca valori intriseci si individuale. actualele amoebe din ecosistem au simtit mirosul de verde si s-au gasit membri ai acestui ecosistem. din fericire, multi au realizat ca nu sunt facuti pentru asta si acum sunt specialisti in facebook, hi5 sau alte reuniuni de sexe. ecosistemul numit blog se autocurata, temporarii sai ocupanti pleaca de buna voie.  iar dupa plecarea lor, cu sa fara tipete de durere fata de lumea nedreapta care i-a inteles, advertiserii tot ne vor da bani. pentru ca noi suntem aici de la inceput, am muncit zi de zi, fara oprire, fara weekenduri, fara vacante, dormind la ore mici si trezindu-ne la prima geana de lumina. de aceea scriem bine, de aceea ne citesc oamenii, de aceea trezim reactii, pro sau contra, de aceea trezim sentimente de iubire sau de ura. pentru ca suntem buni in ceea ce facem si suntem profesionisti. cine vrea si cine poate tine ritmul, e binevenit. cine nu, e rugat sa mearga pe facebook, sa tina niste conferinte despre SEO.</span><span class="text_exposed_hide"><span class="text_exposed_link"><a onclick="CSS.addClass($(&quot;id_4ee71f45c0a895d38516849&quot;), &quot;text_exposed&quot;);">See More</a></span></span></div><span class="translatedBody"></span></span><div class="commentActions fsm fwn fcg"><abbr title="Monday, December 12, 2011 at 12:32pm" data-utime="1323721946" class="timestamp livetimestamp">13 hours ago</abbr> · <span class="comment_like_125185 fsm fwn fcg"><a tooltip="1" tooltip-uri="/ajax/like/tooltip.php?comment_fbid=124132021035416&amp;comment_from=100002462065329" title="Loading..." tooltip-alignh="center" class="comment_like_button" rel="dialog" href="/browse/likes/?id=124132021035416" ajaxify="/ajax/browser/dialog/likes/?id=124132021035416"><img class="cmt_like_icon" src="https://s-static.ak.facebook.com/rsrc.php/v1/yw/r/drP8vlvSl_8.gif" alt="" /> 2</a></span></div></div></div></li><li class="uiUfiComment comment_127025 ufiItem ufiItem"><div class="UIImageBlock clearfix uiUfiActorBlock"><a class="actorPic UIImageBlock_Image UIImageBlock_SMALL_Image" data-ft="&#123;&quot;type&quot;:34&#125;" tabindex="-1" href="http://www.facebook.com/vali.petcu.zoso"><img class="uiProfilePhoto uiProfilePhotoMedium img" src="https://fbcdn-profile-a.akamaihd.ne